services/api/ 下跑 uvicorn 会生成 .err.log / .out.log,之前漏 ignore 导致污染了 working tree 5+ 天。
与 `**/*.db` / `services/api/.env` 同节追加 `**/uvicorn.*.log`。

Co-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .gitignore | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/.gitignore b/.gitignore
index ecd7ca9..d2fc225 100644
--- a/.gitignore
+++ b/.gitignore
@@ -21,6 +21,7 @@ app/build/
 **/.coverage
 **/*.db
 services/api/.env
+**/uvicorn.*.log
 
 # Generated local acceptance evidence and scratch output
 artifacts/
